<title>UK: Reed shares gain after U.S. acquisition.</title>
<headline>Reed shares gain after U.S. acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Reed International Plc were among the few gainers among leading UK shares on Monday as the market welcomed the publishing group's latest U.S. acquisition, dealers and analysts said.</p>
<p>Rebounding from Friday's seven-week low, Reed shares were up 5p or 0.9 percent at 577 by 0829 GMT in volume of 542,710 shares, as the FTSE 100 index dropped some 40 points.</p>
</text>
